<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - VLSI raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - VLSI raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities raised its recommendation on VLSI Technology Inc to buy from hold, according to a source at Prudential.</p>
<p>-- VLSI shares were up 13/16 to 17-3/4 in early Tuesday Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
